sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent (signed)
    participant T as Target Server
    participant K as Bot's FQDN (/.well-known)
    A->>T: Signed HTTP request (Ed25519, RFC 9421)
    T->>K: GET /.well-known/http-message-signatures-directory
    K-->>T: JWKS (Ed25519 public key)
    T->>T: Extract keyid, verify signature
